abstract: >-
  A practical architecture for orchestrating specialized AI agents across the
  software testing lifecycle while keeping deterministic engineering controls
  authoritative. The work covers role-specialized agents, structured contracts,
  explicit workflow state, evidence-preserving handoffs, least privilege,
  human approval, execution controls, multi-agent evaluation, security,
  observability, CI/CD quality gates and evidence-backed release decisions.
